<title>CHINA: CHINNEY INV YEARLY NET PROFIT UP 55 PCT.</title>
<headline>CHINNEY INV YEARLY NET PROFIT UP 55 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   66.6	  vs 46.4</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    11.5	  vs 8.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  445.38 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    332.85	vs 214.26</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,333.89    vs 1,535.14</p>
<p>    Company name		 Chinney Investments Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 22-25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 22</p>
<p>NOTE - Chinney Investments engages in garment manufacturing, trading and building construction.</p>
<p>The company proposed a special cash bonus of four H.K. cents per share.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of an investment property.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 18.5 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of three cents and speical cash bonus) vs 11 cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
